    "- **Business example:** A table of monthly sales by region stored as a 2-D array.\n",
    "- **AI/ML example:** A batch of images is a 4-D ndarray (samples, height, width, channels).\n",
    "\n",
    "Each example represents the concept because it shows the same idea: apply the operation to many values or records in one consistent step."
