    "\n",
    "### Step 2 – Demonstrate the Concept\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Simple example:** Flattening can turn a matrix-like input into a feature vector.\n",
    "- **Real-world analogy:** Unrolling a rolled-up sheet into one long strip.\n",
    "- **Business example:** Converting a 2-D table into one list for a simple summary.\n",
    "- **AI/ML example:** Flattening image pixels into a feature vector for a basic classifier.\n",
    "\n",
    "Each example represents the concept because it shows the same idea: apply the operation to many values or records in one consistent step."
